"the Internet which can be conveniently accessed in order to obtain or "
"deposit keys. Select from the drop down list to specify which key server "
"should be used.</p> "
"<p>Often these keys are held by people whom the user has never met and as "
"such the authenticity is dubious at best. Refer to the GnuPG manual covering "
